<title>USA: KLLM Transport CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>KLLM Transport CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLLM Transport Services Inc said Tuesday that J. Kirby Lane has resigned as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Effective today, the company said, Vice President of Finance Steven Dutro will assume the role of acting chief financial officer while the company searches for a permanent replacement.</p>
<p>The company declined to comment on the reason for Lane's departure.</p>
</text>
